# ─── ATS deployment configuration ───────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` on the VPS before `docker compose up`.

# Host port the container's nginx (port 80) is published on.
# nginx-proxy-manager at https://recruitment.erpoman.in forwards to
# 72.61.201.164:5174, so leave this as 5174 unless you change NPM too.
APP_PORT=5174

# ─── Runtime knobs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ATS is a fully-static client-side SPA — there is no server
# component to configure here. The following are configured *inside*
# the app at runtime and stored in the browser's localStorage:
#   - AI provider key (Anthropic or OpenAI)  → Sidebar → Settings
#   - Company profile, logo, intake webhook  → Company Settings
#   - Demo login credentials                  → demo@ats.local / demo1234
#
# So there is nothing to bake in at build time today.
